    Constrain setuptools for kolla tox environments.

    Setuptools v82.0.0 removed pkg_resources, so stay below that. At the
    other end, kolla master's pyproject.toml uses a PEP 639 SPDX license
    expression (license = "Apache-2.0"), which setuptools only
    understands from v77.0.3 onwards. The setuptools that virtualenv
    seeds on Debian 12 is 66.1.1, and a >=64.0.0 floor never forces pip
    to upgrade the seeded copy, so tox's "setup.py --name" fails to
    parse pyproject.toml. Raising the floor forces the upgrade.

    Change-Id: I55851cb5d8f0bb089bd9f49e70bb18a5f270573a
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

